  "colors": "UB",
  "identity": "A UB Faerie kindred token deck. Three engines manufacture 1/1 blue-and-black Faerie tokens with flying — Bitterbloom Bearer every upkeep, Pestered Wellguard every time it becomes tapped (attacking OR convoking), and Glen Elendra's Answer once per spell it counters. Five colourless permanents read the resulting Faerie count: Gathering Stone x2 discounts every Faerie spell and digs one off the top each upkeep, Dawn-Blessed Pennant drains a life per Faerie entering and later rebuys one from the graveyard, Stalactite Dagger adds a changeling body, and Firdoch Core x2 is itself a Faerie that taps for any colour and can become a 4/4. Because those engines are artifacts in a cube with only four artifact answers — none of them castable in blue or black — the deck's core is close to unanswerable.",
